{"version":"V28.31-canvas-drag","updatedAt":"2026-06-08T13:00:00.000Z","note":"V28.31 (screen 3) Move blocks on the GOST schematic by finger. Open the schematic fullscreen, tap ✥ to enter move mode, then drag a block (a group column with its lines, or the input chain, or a single line) up/down/left/right; positions are saved. ⟲ restores the automatic layout. Two-finger pinch still zooms, one finger pans. Horizontal moves keep the busbar connection; large vertical moves may leave a small gap at the bus (wires are not re-routed yet) — use ⟲ to reset. This release also bundles the recent shield/scheme changes together for consistency."}
